<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine Jan industrial production falls 12.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Ukraine Jan industrial production falls 12.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine industrial production fell 12.2 percent in January after falling 3.3 percent in December, the Statistics Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    UKRAINE INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION   Jan 97   Dec 96   Jan 96</p>
<p>    mth/mtn change (percent)	  -12.2    -3.3     -9.5</p>
<p>    year/year change (percent)	 -8.1    -5.1	n/a</p>
<p>The government has forecast zero growth in 1997.</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom +380 44 229 2264</p>
